g sovereign, yet must decline the offer of a binding peace. Our legions stand strong and ready, rendering such a covenant unnecessary for our security or ambitions. We shall maintain our current posture until the season turns, leaving the matter of borders to be decided by the field rather than the pen.\"},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"logprobs\":null,\"matched_stop\":248046}],\"model\":\"Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8\",\"created\":1793991485,\"usage\":{\"prompt_tokens\":222,\"total_tokens\":296,\"completion_tokens\":74,\"prompt_tokens_details\":null,\"reasoning_tokens\":0,\"completion_tokens_details\":{\"reasoning_tokens\":0}}}", "text": "Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8:c65634b2c6ee19cc1ab9ef38eb33640fc9de1e15801146c87f0bb9cec1427a1f:eac2d6a97adfa02e6e67446e7af8287cad0d153d4752bd5e7a3be04103453953", "signature": "0xd37c482995e56f5e220869725b803f0032d36609cc393cf6afd756c9409e199d714e32bb355bbce7e9be850f9a69d8fb622715a6597c88586060d25e230f8da71b", "signingAddress": "0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf", "signatureKind": "provider_tee"}], "attestation": {"nonce": "65713668cddb0fd0f29e48d8ac4637e3a1189d73fd4450e884fdb13f5453912d", "model": "Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-FP8", "report": {"model_attestations": [{"signing_address": "0xfdbd7952498b333206f360d71d97a1e0961e8ddf"}]}}, "rollSecret": "552b5665d85ef4fa5abce3297d1cb298e862944ce41ff853f598a584ad89b930", "rollSalt": "debe6928ad89724f8da7fe27e8f2df30484876acd0e1f1ba022a8210febdad51", "agendaSalts": ["98750d4f5d3af050fa56c38d55b5e0306742be032fb9d1f37ca166bbba40e31c", "f015740f21858b6f5548c79f3e748a97c298c173be633bd78877d4adbb63f4e8", "c71ffdd1d0ef5adbeab11a2f8a8c7851f8723641227ffe144ce86148fb73f97f", "5e9eb3d3c517811451553c924e6b5a82e50eb6218ae4aedd75045b14bf884f1c"]}